ocols**\\n\\nI need to follow the protocol for heartbeats, which should remain consistent. The user mentioned if everything's fine, I should respond with HEARTBEAT_OK. It makes me wonder if I must stick to the strict guidelines of the file or if this chat heartbeat is something different. Previous assistants responded with alerts, so it seems I can do the same. I’ll clarify my approach, ensuring I’m aligned with the user’s needs!\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aTTrNrgMQlgLLC2d8VEr134l|fc_094315fd17a24ad60169be99f7b6548191a0ca9b3032f90a5a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/HEARTBEAT.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_moYTyzi7cggJ0IzirrVD5pCz|fc_094315fd17a24ad60169be99f7b6688191b960125f75c51458","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/SESSION-STATE.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/SESSION-STATE.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_iG9cYTHYBuXF2Eo9yaKzzQfr|fc_094315fd17a24ad60169be99f7b67081918c69f5e199e46d15","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/working-buffer.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/working-buffer.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6bVUgtQh7AFMqmf7brUiM9E0|fc_094315fd17a24ad60169be99f7b6748191b2ddf04a4d2fa436","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6hfqDuC6frYHnZUcKDh4qIy2|fc_094315fd17a24ad60169be99f7b6788191b37f13980df5966e","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-21.md"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/lfant/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-03-21.md\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_TmLh8KRirwPgIefZclsO4WJM|fc_094315fd17a24ad60169be99f7b6